Hosts 2
Switches 1
Links 2

# Define hosts
host h1 , queue q1
host h2 , queue q2

# Define switch with two ports
switch s1 , queue q3 queue q4

# Define host queues
queue q1 , type queue speed 1 Mbps size 1000 dst p1
queue q2 , type queue speed 1 Mbps size 1000 dst p2

# Define switch queues
queue q3 , type queue speed 1 Mbps size 1000 dst p3
queue q4 , type queue speed 1 Mbps size 1000 dst p4

# Define pipes to connect hosts to switch
pipe p1 , latency 10 us dst q3
pipe p2 , latency 10 us dst q4

# Define pipes to connect switch back to hosts
pipe p3 , latency 10 us dst q2
pipe p4 , latency 10 us dst q1